# TypeScript incremental build cache
*.tsbuildinfo

# DMARC and TLS-RPT reports. They arrive by mail, are parsed into the report
# tables on delivery, and are named for the reporter and the date range: data,
# never source.
#
# The pattern here was "*json" - no dot - which ignored every .json file in the
# repository. The ones already committed survived only because .gitignore does
# not apply to tracked files; any new one - another language's messages, a new
# service's package.json - would have been silently left out of every commit.
*.json.gz
*.xml.gz
*.zip.gz
